DOMAIN,www.bing.com,PROXY
# > GitHub Copilot
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubcopilot.com,PROXY

# Perplexity
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,perplexity.ai,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pplx.ai,PROXY
DOMAIN,pplx-res.cloudinary.com,PROXY

# xAI
